@startuml
title File Redaction Sequence
' Validated against redactor.py:redact_file and cli.py
actor Operator
participant CLI
participant "Facade\n(Redactor)" as Facade
participant "Streaming engine" as Stream
participant "Detection Tiers" as Detect
participant Arbitration as Arb
participant "Redaction policy" as Policy
database "File system" as FS
Operator -> CLI : redact input -> output [options]
CLI -> Facade : redact_file(input, output)
Facade -> FS : open temporary output\n(restricted access)
loop For each chunk until input exhausted
    Stream -> Stream : Read next window\n(buffer + overlap)
    Stream -> Detect : detect(window text)
    Detect --> Stream : candidate detections
    Stream -> Arb : adjust / filter / resolve
    Arb --> Stream : final detections
    Stream -> Policy : apply(window, detections)
    Policy --> Stream : redacted window
    Stream -> FS : write redacted window
    Stream -> Stream : retain overlap margin
end
Facade -> FS : atomically replace output\nwith temporary file
Facade -> CLI : RedactionStats(counts, sizes)
CLI -> Operator : summary + exit status
@enduml
